'''Beware''':  
A secondary spawn mechanic allows a Diremaw to emerge from its rotting corpse when [[Gnomish Pesticides]] are used during the [[Dangerous_Depths_Quest/Spoiler#Pesticide|Dangerous Depths Quest]]. This spawn does '''not''' display the usual three [[Teleport Effect]] warnings and '''cannot''' be blocked. As a result, a player could drag a Diremaw corpse into a semi-safe area and trigger this mechanic to ambush or kill another player.
