* In older times (prior to 2001), Dragons were [[Summon Creature|summonable]], and during these times it was possible to summon up to 8 creatures at once (requiring very high [[mana]]). Only the highest leveled [[mage]]s could summon them (back when the highest [[level]]s were only around level 60 or 70). It was a somewhat common occurrence to see mages walking the streets of [[Thais]] with several dragons summoned at one time. It was also possible to set summons free by logging out of the game, turning the summons into wild creatures. Often mages would leave the game after summoning as many as 8 dragons in the middle of major [[Hometowns|cities]], causing chaos.
