| notes          = These creatures can be skinned with an [[Obsidian Knife]]. See also: [[Minotaur Leather/Skinning]]. <gallery captionalign="center" mode="nolines">Execowtioner Artwork.jpg|Official [[Creature Artwork]]</gallery>
| behaviour      = Execowtioners fight until death.
| runsat         = 0
| speed          = 135
| strategy       = Don't let their appearance fool you, as their attacks can be stronger than those of a [[Behemoth]] or a [[Destroyer]].

'''[[Paladin]]s:''' Throw fire walls on the ground and run around them, while healing constantly, for their distance attacks are very strong. Don't let them touch you, and if that happens, be ready to cast salvation, because their melee attacks may hit more than 400 when you're wearing no shield.

'''[[Knight]]s:''' Reach them as soon as possible, as they can spam their strong [[Whirlwind Throw]] up to three times in a row if they are not hitting you with [[Melee]]. Try to lure them away from other Minotaurs, as their high amount of [[Hit Point]]s combined with their very strong combos and the attacks from other Minotaurs can spell doom even on the most experienced Knights.
