| notes          = These creatures can be skinned with an [[Obsidian Knife]]. See also: [[Minotaur Leather/Skinning]]. <gallery captionalign="center" mode="nolines">Moohtant Artwork.jpg|Official [[Creature Artwork]]</gallery>
