| strategy       = There are two ways of succeeding in the killing of Omrafir.<br>First of all you have to trap Omrafir in a corner using [[Wild Growth Rune]]s or [[Magic Wall Rune]]s and make sure you do not stand in the range of his strong fire beam as it has been confirmed to hit a high level mage for close to 13k dmg with mana shield. Then you can choose between these two ways of killing:<br>'''Short:''' Once he is trapped kill him using single-target attacks such as [[Ice Strike]], [[Icicle Rune]]s or [[Sudden Death Rune]]s and make sure you <u>do not</u> kill a single flame. If you managed not to kill a single flame he will fight until death without exploding.<br>
'''Long:''' Once he is trapped attack him using the spells and runes you would like. This time you do not have to pay attention to his flames. Keep attacking him until he exploded a total of <u>three times</u> and then kill him as he will not explode a fourth time no matter if you kill his flames again or not.<br><br>
