| sounds         = {{Sound List|PRAISED BE MY MASTERS, THE RUTHLESS SEVEN!|YOU ARE DOOMED!|ORSHABAAL IS BACK!|Be prepared for the day my masters will come for you!|SOULS FOR ORSHABAAL!}}
| implemented    = 7.4
