| notes          = She is a daughter of [[Cadwgan Etzel]] and [[Ansegild]]. She is a sister of [[Grand Master Oberon|Oberon]] and [[Kesar Etzel]], and a half-sister of [[Eldoran Etzel]]. She is the leader of the [[Order of the Cobra]].
| sounds         = {{Sound List| Galthen... is that you?| Where... have you been all that time?| What...? How dare you? Give me that back!| Aaaaaaah!!!}}
| runsat         = 0
