| notes          = He is one of the [[Minotaur]] bosses. He has a [[Secret Hideout]] near the [[Dwarf Mines]] of [[Kazordoon]] which he rarely visits. He is one of the few Minotaurs that has been proven to be able to write (as evidenced by [[The Fox Is Out (Book)|this document]]). You can use an [[Obsidian Knife]] on his corpse in order to skin [[Minotaur Leather]].
