1st mechanic: When [[Greed]] appears, Walk the boss over the teleport so that it changes its color then walk the [[Greed]] on the teleport so it disappears. Shooters should focus on the summons and ads to clear the way for the knights handling the boss and the [[Greed]]. The longer it takes to get rid of the [[Greed]], the more [[Greed]] will appear. 

